text The bulletin board in front of the staff room.
text As we walk by, I stop to look at it again.
text Over at the scribbling by Tomoyo's name...
text Below "delinquent girl" was scribbled "What do you mean?"
text Probably written by some student that was curious.
text I could block out the text with a magic marker, but I feel that might fan the flames even more.
text I should probably ask Tomoyo.
