text I'm still bothered about the bulletin board, so I head down to the first floor again.
text Down the hallway... there is a crowd.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Don't tell me...)
text I rush up and force my way through.
text As I thought, the amount of scribbling on the bulletin board has increased.
text The rumors I knew from before were now also written down there.
text There's quite a lot of them.
