text After the spectators disappear, I desperately try erasing the notes with an eraser.
text ......
text What am I even doing...?
text If I want Tomoyo to lose, then all I have to do is shut up and do nothing.
text No, in my situation, I should actually be trying to stand in the way of Tomoyo's election...
text Even so, I'm...
text Really...
text Just what am I doing...?
